  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ECU environm masterpl &#xc5;F</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ECU milj&#xf6;masterplan &#xc5;F</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xc5;F-IPK har i uppdrag att ta fram en milj&#xf6;masterplan f&#xf6;r Quito kommun. Insatsen genomf&#xf6;rs i sju steg d&#xe4;r man f&#xf6;rst analyserar den akutella milj&#xf6;situationen p&#xe5; en rad omr&#xe5;den och d&#xe4;refter prioriterar &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder kopplat till de finansieringsm&#xf6;jligheter som f&#xf6;religger.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#xc5;F-IPK shall design a environmental master plan for the municipality of Quito. The project is to be carried out in seven steps, first analysing the current environmental situation in certain areas and the prioritizing certain measures connected to the suitable financial possibilities.</narrative>
  </description>
